# External review

The implementer writes `review/OUTBOX.md` for a real commit SHA. ChatGPT is the external reviewer only after a human or an authorized integration returns a response. Never invent `APPROVE_FOR_MANUAL_SUBMISSION`.

A reviewer command is a proposal. Check it against the competition rules before running it. Approval applies to one SHA. Any later functional change invalidates it.

If the existing ChatGPT conversation URL is unknown, do not search browser history. Leave the handoff for the user.
